{{<shell}}{{$content}}
<p class="crumb"><a href="{{rulesUrl}}">&larr; Mail</a></p>
<h1>Mail log</h1>
<p class="hint">Every message that arrived, what was decided about it, and what the far end said
  back. The last {{kept}} per domain. This is metadata and a short preview &mdash; a forwarder that
  kept copies would be a mail store nobody agreed to run.</p>
<form class="tools" method="get" action="{{action}}" data-filters>
  <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="trouble" value="1"{{#troublesOnly}} checked{{/troublesOnly}}> only what went wrong</label>
  <noscript><button type="submit" class="quiet">Filter</button></noscript>
</form>
<div class="scroll panel" data-panel="{{panelUrl}}">{{{panel}}}</div>
{{/content}}{{/shell}}
